# URL patterns excluded from lychee (regex, one per line).
# Prefer excludes over editing site content; list follow-ups below.

# Decorative / non-HTTP
^data:
^mailto:

# LinkedIn commonly returns 999 to automated clients
^https://www\.linkedin\.com/

# Publisher / DOI hosts that block CI user-agents (403) while remaining valid citations
^https://doi\.org/
^https://netflixtechblog\.com/
^https://www\.imf\.org/

# Follow-ups (remove an exclude only after the underlying URL is fixed):
# - Drop DOI / publisher excludes once those hosts allow CI fetches (or host mirrors)
# - Optionally resolve root-relative paths (e.g. /images/...) via lychee root-dir/base-url
